CrownLeague_GlaciasRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "I am GLACIA. I crossed the sea\n"
    .string "from HOENN looking for a TRAINER\l"
    .string "who could truly test me.\p"
    .string "My ICE POKéMON have never been\n"
    .string "colder. Show me some real fire!$"

CrownLeague_GlaciasRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Your fire melted my ice. Well done.$"

CrownLeague_GlaciasRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Go ahead. DRAKE, the last of us,\n"
    .string "is waiting beyond that door.$"

